// Google Workspace: which Reports API applications this account collects, 30 days,
// as counts. The control for every Google negative: an application absent here is a
// gap, never a zero. Gmail settings (forwarding, filters, delegation) arrive only
// with a "gmail" application; without it, mail-side persistence cannot be checked.
GSuite
| where timestamp > ago(30d)
| summarize events = count(), users = dcount(tolower(tostring(actor.email))),
    last = max(timestamp) by app = tostring(id.applicationName)
| order by events desc
| take 1000
